{"_id":"school0000000000000001","name":"Yasuki Courtier School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Commerce-focused courtiers specializing in trade and negotiation. [CR p.73-97]</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Perception<br>\n<strong>Skills:</strong> Commerce (Appraisal), Courtier, Defense, Etiquette, Intimidation, Sincerity (Deceit), any one Merchant skill<br>\n<strong>Honor:</strong> 2.5<br>\n<strong>Outfit:</strong> Traditional Clothing, Wakizashi, Knife, Calligraphy Set, Traveling Pack, 5 koku</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: THE WAY OF THE CARP</h4>\n<p>Free Raise on Commerce. No Honor/Glory loss for public Commerce use. Commerce/Perception vs Etiquette/Awareness to discern what someone wants.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: DO AS WE SAY</h4>\n<p>School Rank times per session: re-roll failed Sincerity or Intimidation (keep second roll).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: TREASURES OF THE CARP</h4>\n<p>Commerce/Awareness TN 20 to locate rare item for someone. Raises for rarer items.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: WILES OF THE CARP</h4>\n<p>Social Skill Rolls to lie/deceive you: +5x School Rank to TN.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: WHAT IS YOURS IS MINE</h4>\n<p>Provide material item someone needs: +5k0 to Contested Social Rolls vs them for 24 hours.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Crab/Courtier","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000002","name":"Doji Courtier School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Premier courtiers specializing in favors and honor-based influence. [CR p.75-107]</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Awareness<br>\n<strong>Skills:</strong> Calligraphy, Courtier (Manipulation), Etiquette (Courtesy), Perform: Storytelling, Sincerity, Tea Ceremony, any one Artisan or Perform skill<br>\n<strong>Honor:</strong> 6.5<br>\n<strong>Outfit:</strong> Extravagant Clothing, Wakizashi, any 1 weapon, Calligraphy Set, Traveling Pack, 10 koku</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: THE SOUL OF HONOR</h4>\n<p>Honor 6.0+: Free Raise on Courtier, Sincerity, Etiquette. Courtier (Manipulation)/Awareness vs Etiquette (Courtesy)/Awareness to learn what someone needs.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: SPEAKING IN SILENCE</h4>\n<p>Courtier/Intelligence TN 15 to use Cadence (communicate with Doji Courtiers or Courtier 5+). Raises for complex ideas.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: THE PERFECT GIFT</h4>\n<p>In court/urban: Courtier/Awareness TN 20 to acquire gift/favor for someone. Success: take as 1-point Ally (no XP cost, GM approval).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: VOICE OF HONOR</h4>\n<p>Courtier (Manipulation)/Awareness vs Etiquette (Courtesy)/Awareness: win forces opponent to concede position conflicts with Honor/Bushido.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: THE GIFT OF THE LADY</h4>\n<p>Courtier (Manipulation)/Awareness vs Etiquette (Courtesy)/Willpower (+5k0 if Ally): shift emotions favorably, persuade to follow advice.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Crane/Courtier","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000003","name":"Kitsuki Investigator School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Evidence-based investigators with perfect recall. [CR p.75-109]</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Perception<br>\n<strong>Skills:</strong> Courtier, Etiquette (Courtesy), Investigation (Interrogation), Kenjutsu, Meditation, Sincerity, any one Lore skill<br>\n<strong>Honor:</strong> 5.5<br>\n<strong>Outfit:</strong> Traditional Clothing, Wakizashi, Knife, Calligraphy Set, Traveling Pack, 5 koku</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: KITSUKI'S METHOD</h4>\n<p>Free Raise on Investigation. Add Perception to Armor TN in skirmish.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: WISDOM THE WIND BRINGS</h4>\n<p>Social Skill Rolls to lie/deceive you or Feint/Disarm vs you: +5 per School Rank to TN.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: KNOW THE RHYTHM OF THE HEART</h4>\n<p>Investigation (Notice)/Perception vs Intelligence x5: learn true personality and motivations.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: FINDING THE PATH</h4>\n<p>Investigation (Interrogation)/Intelligence vs Etiquette (Courtesy)/Intelligence: identify ally or enemy. Raises for more. Once per person per day.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: THE EYES BETRAY THE HEART</h4>\n<p>Auto-detect lies: Investigation (Interrogation)/Perception vs Sincerity (Deceit)/Willpower. If know they're lying: +5k0 and Raises reveal more info.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Dragon/Courtier","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000004","name":"Ikoma Bard School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Historians and storytellers who inspire through ancestral tales. [CR p.83-117]</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Intelligence<br>\n<strong>Skills:</strong> Courtier, Etiquette, Lore: History (Lion Clan), Perform: Storytelling, Sincerity (Honesty), any one High Skill, any one Bugei Skill<br>\n<strong>Honor:</strong> 6.5<br>\n<strong>Outfit:</strong> Traditional Clothing, Wakizashi, Knife, Calligraphy Set, Traveling Pack, 5 koku</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: THE HERALD OF GLORY</h4>\n<p>Gain Precise Memory (free, or refund if have). Perform: Storytelling/Awareness TN 20 to grant School Rank Glory points (School Rank times per person per month).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: THE HEART OF THE LION</h4>\n<p>No Honor/Glory loss for public emotion if for Lion/honorable cause. Intimidation/Temptation vs you: +5 per School Rank to TN.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: THE VOICE OF THE ANCESTORS</h4>\n<p>Before battle, Perform: Oratory/Awareness TN 15+5 per person (+5 per non-Lion): inspired add Honor Rank to one Skill Roll during battle.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: THE STRENGTH OF TRADITION</h4>\n<p>School Rank times per session: Perform: Storytelling/Awareness TN 25 to let ally re-roll failed roll with +Honor Rank unkept dice. Second fail: lose 2 Honor.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: EVERY LION IS YOUR BROTHER</h4>\n<p>5 times per session in Contested Social Roll: cite history for +Perform: Storytelling Rank unkept dice.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Lion/Courtier","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000005","name":"Yoritomo Courtier School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Intimidation-focused courtiers who bully and pressure opponents. [CR p.72-106]</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Willpower<br>\n<strong>Skills:</strong> Commerce (Appraisal), Courtier, Defense, Etiquette, Intimidation (Control), Sincerity, any one Merchant or Lore skill<br>\n<strong>Honor:</strong> 2.5<br>\n<strong>Outfit:</strong> Extravagant Clothing, Wakizashi, any 1 weapon, Calligraphy Set, Traveling Pack, 10 koku</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: DUTY BEFORE HONOR</h4>\n<p>No Glory/Honor loss for public Commerce or Intimidation (Control). School Rank Free Raises vs ronin/bandits/gang members/mercenaries/pirates/lawless.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: STORM HEART</h4>\n<p>Intimidation (Control): Willpower +1 Rank (or +2 vs lower Status).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: COMMAND THE WINDS</h4>\n<p>School Rank times per session: failed Sincerity re-roll as Intimidation (Control), keep Intimidation result.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: WILL OF THE STORM</h4>\n<p>Intimidation (Control)/Willpower vs Etiquette (Courtesy)/Willpower: win prevents Void spending vs you for 1 hour, -3k0 to Social Rolls vs you.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: STRENGTH IN ALL THINGS</h4>\n<p>Using Intimidation or resisting Intimidation/Temptation/Fear: +5k0.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Mantis/Courtier","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000006","name":"Asako Loremaster School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Scholarly courtiers who leverage knowledge in court. [CR p.77-107]</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Intelligence<br>\n<strong>Skills:</strong> Courtier, Etiquette (Courtesy), Lore: History, Lore: Theology (Fortunes), Meditation, Sincerity, any Lore skill<br>\n<strong>Honor:</strong> 6.5<br>\n<strong>Outfit:</strong> Sensible Clothing, Wakizashi, Calligraphy Set, Traveling Pack, 5 koku</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: TEMPLE OF THE SOUL</h4>\n<p>Free Raise on Lore Skills. Spend Void on Etiquette: +3k1 (not +1k1).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: FROM THE ASHES</h4>\n<p>After 1 day observing court: Lore: History/Perception TN 20 for +2k0 to Social Skill Rolls for 2 days in that court. Re-activate when expires.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: VOICE OF THE UNIVERSE</h4>\n<p>1 hour conversation, Lore: History/Intelligence TN 25: ally adds Lore: History Rank to Social Skill Rolls for 24 hours. Raise twice for 1 more ally.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: INVINCIBLE MIND</h4>\n<p>Failed Contested Social Skill Roll to resist influence: re-roll using Intelligence. Keep second roll. Not vs Fear.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: WISDOM OF THE AGES</h4>\n<p>Lore Skill Rolls (including School Techniques): +5k0.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Phoenix/Courtier","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000007","name":"Bayushi Courtier School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Manipulative courtiers who exploit secrets and weaknesses. [CR p.68-101]</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Awareness<br>\n<strong>Skills:</strong> Calligraphy, Courtier (Gossip), Etiquette, Investigation, Sincerity (Deceit), Temptation, any one High skill<br>\n<strong>Honor:</strong> 2.5<br>\n<strong>Outfit:</strong> Extravagant Clothing, Wakizashi, any 1 weapon, Calligraphy Set, Traveling Pack, 5 koku</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: WEAKNESS IS MY STRENGTH</h4>\n<p>Contested Social Roll: Free Raise per 3 points Mental/Social Disadvantages opponent has (max 5 Free Raises). Free Raise on Courtier (Gossip), no Raise to conceal source.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: SHALLOW WATERS</h4>\n<p>Investigation/Awareness vs Etiquette/Awareness: learn lowest Mental Trait and lowest Social Skill (1+ Rank). Spend Void for next lowest.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: SECRETS ARE BIRTHMARKS</h4>\n<p>Courtier (Manipulation)/Awareness vs Etiquette (Courtesy)/Awareness: reveal Mental/Social Disadvantage (or Advantage if none). Disadvantage: take 2-point Blackmail (no XP, GM approval).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: SCRUTINY'S SWEET STING</h4>\n<p>Contested Social vs Blackmail target: their dice don't explode. Any Contested Social: spend Void to force them to use Mental Trait of your choice.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: NO MORE MASKS</h4>\n<p>School Rank times per session: Courtier (Gossip)/Awareness vs Etiquette (Courtesy)/Awareness (+5k0 if Blackmail): inflict Bad Reputation, Sworn Enemy, or Obligation for 1 month.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Scorpion/Courtier","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000008","name":"Ide Emissary School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Peaceful mediators who defuse conflicts and build alliances. [CR p.89-128]</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Awareness<br>\n<strong>Skills:</strong> Calligraphy, Commerce, Courtier, Etiquette (Conversation), Horsemanship, Sincerity (Honesty), any one High or Perform skill<br>\n<strong>Honor:</strong> 5.5<br>\n<strong>Outfit:</strong> Extravagant Clothing, Wakizashi, any 1 weapon, Calligraphy Set, Traveling Pack, 10 koku</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: THE HEART SPEAKS</h4>\n<p>Etiquette (Courtesy)/Awareness TN 20 to avoid giving offense. Free Raise on Sincerity (Honesty). Sincerity (Deceit): +5 TN.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: PIERCING THE VEILS</h4>\n<p>Etiquette/Awareness vs Etiquette/Willpower: learn true emotions. Raises for better info.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: THE HEART LISTENS</h4>\n<p>10+ minutes conversation, Sincerity (Honesty)/Awareness vs Etiquette (Courtesy)/Willpower: shift attitude positively. 2+ Raises: regard as Ally for day. Not vs Sworn Enemies.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: ANSWERING THE HEART</h4>\n<p>Using Rank 2 or 3 techniques: roll +School Rank unkept dice.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: THE IMMOVABLE HAND OF PEACE</h4>\n<p>Spend Void, Sincerity (Honesty)/Awareness vs Etiquette (Courtesy)/Awareness: target cannot take hostile action vs you for 2x School Rank hours (if you don't either). Not vs Honor &lt;2.0.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Unicorn/Courtier","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
